      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    starting_assets = 160.0\n    growth_rate = 0.25\n    high_watermark = 198.0\n    management_fee_rate = 0.02\n    hurdle_rate = 0.10\n    performance_fee_rate = 0.20\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    ending_assets = starting_assets * (1 + growth_rate)\n    management_fee = ending_assets * management_fee_rate\n\n    # The 10% soft hurdle is net of the management fee.\n    hurdle_value = starting_assets * (1 + hurdle_rate) + management_fee\n    net_ending_assets = ending_assets - management_fee\n\n    incentive_base = max(0.0, net_ending_assets - max(high_watermark, hurdle_value))\n    performance_fee = incentive_base * performance_fee_rate\n\n    total_fees = management_fee + performance_fee\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_fees, 1)\n```",
